# PURPOSE
# -------
# QbitDialer is the Qbit command/brain authority.
#
# IMPORTANT BOOT RULE:
#
#     CONSTRUCT != START
#
# __init__() MUST:
#     - create/bind references
#     - validate dependencies
#     - establish state
#     - prepare queues
#     - prepare callbacks
#
# __init__() MUST NOT:
#     - start threads
#     - start asyncio loops
#     - schedule asyncio tasks
#     - start QbitQueueLoop
#     - start HeartbeatEmitter
#     - activate TrackSystem
#     - mark QBIT channel ACTIVE
#     - emit boot events requiring the runtime
#     - construct another QbitDialer
#
# Runtime activation belongs to:
#
#     start()
#     activate()
#     start_runtime_loops()
#
# Heartbeat remains the system clock.
# QbitDialer remains the brain/command authority.
# QbitQueueLoop remains the queue authority.
# ==========================================================

